msgctxt "woh_comb:76"
msgid "reduces your EXPERIENCE by 5 and raises your chance to hit by 10% for the rest of this encounter"
msgstr "reduce tu EXPERIENCIA en 5 y aumenta tu probabilidad de impacto un 10% durante el resto del encuentro"

