msgstr "MAL PREPARADO"

#. Opción de «TIRED» (woh_nana:539). Opciones: <<...yawn...>> · UNDER-PREPARED · -1 to all stats for all event skill checks · <<I should've brought it>> · AT A CROSSROADS.
