"We would like to thank you on behalf of our client for participating in this vigil on such short notice.\n"
"\n"
"He was a spiritual person and left instructions we are asking you to follow closely."
msgstr ""
"En nombre de nuestro cliente, queremos agradecerle su participación en este velatorio con tan poca antelación.\n"
"\n"
"Era una persona espiritual y dejó instrucciones que le pedimos que siga al pie de la letra."

