"-AURA OF AZAL-HOTH-\n"
"\n"
"lower DOOM by 10% by completing a mystery\n"
"[PASSIVE]"
msgstr ""
"-AURA DE AZAL-HOTH-\n"
"\n"
"reduce la DOOM un 10% al completar un misterio\n"
"[PASIVO]"

