msgctxt "woh_yon:32"
msgid "You don't find anything else."
msgstr "No encuentras nada más."

msgctxt "woh_yon:33"
msgid ""
"[[I used to live here too. This was the only place that was saf(...)d good.\n"
"All I could do was stay in, eat and sleep. And when the food ran out, just sleep.]]\n"
"[[When someone eventually came for my corpse, I'd already made my way _inside_.]]\n"
"[[You moved it. I can't tell you how happy being with you has made me. Please don't worry, I will keep you safe. I promise.]]"
msgstr ""
"[[Yo también vivía aquí antes. Este era el único lugar que era segu(...)ro y bueno.\n"
"Lo único que podía hacer era quedarme dentro, comer y dormir. Y cuando se acababa la comida, simplemente dormir.]]\n"
"[[Cuando alguien vino por fin a recoger mi cadáver, yo ya me había abierto camino _hacia dentro_.]]\n"
"[[Lo has movido. No sabes lo feliz que me ha hecho estar contigo. No te preocupes, te mantendré a salvo. Te lo prometo.]]"

